# Chapter 4 — Before Fight 4 (Mira vs. Nyra)

@music main_theme
@card DAY 20 OF DARKNESS | The Underground Sanctuary
@bg underground_sanctuary
> The group enters an underground chamber once used by the organization to preserve medicines and supplies.
> Mira notices something on a stone shelf.
> It is a necklace made from two matching pieces of crystal.
> She recognizes it.
@show left mira
MIRA: Nyra...
> A voice answers from the shadows.
NYRA: I wondered if you'd remember.
> Mira turns. Her older sister stands across the chamber.
@show right nyra
> For several seconds, neither moves.
MIRA: I thought you were dead.
NYRA: Would that have made things easier?
MIRA: You were the one person I thought would never leave me.
> Nyra approaches slowly.
NYRA: I never stopped thinking about you.
MIRA: Then why did you leave with Veyr?
NYRA: Because I was tired of watching people suffer while we pretended our little organization could fix everything.
MIRA: Auren believed we could make a difference.
NYRA: Auren believed everyone could be reasoned with.
MIRA: He believed people deserved a choice.
NYRA: And look where that got him.
> Mira's expression hardens.
MIRA: Don't speak about him like that.
> Nyra looks at Darin's gauntlet attached to Mira's belt.
NYRA: Where is Darin?
> Mira doesn't answer.
> Nyra understands.
NYRA: I'm sorry.
MIRA: You helped create the world that killed him.
> Nyra lowers her eyes.
NYRA: Come with me. We can still survive this together.
MIRA: I came here hoping you would say something different.
> Nyra draws her whip.
NYRA: Then I suppose we both came here hoping for something impossible.
> Mira draws her flexible blade.
@title FIGHT 04 | Mira vs. Nyra
